stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> requested: party > 8 and table free
    requested --> approved: manager approves (≤ 10 min)
    requested --> rejected: manager rejects
    requested --> timeout: no answer in 10 min
    approved --> deposit_charged: charge_deposit(key) · written BEFORE booking
    deposit_charged --> booked: create_booking(idempotency key, receipt)
    rejected --> offered_smaller: offer table for 8 · nothing charged
    timeout --> pending_manager: "staff will call you back" · nothing charged
    booked --> [*]
    offered_smaller --> [*]
    pending_manager --> [*]
    note right of deposit_charged
        Resume rule: deposit_charged = true → never charge again
        booking_id set → only confirm
    end note
